20.10.050 Accessory uses, residential development.
The following are permitted accessory uses in attached single-family developments or multifamily developments:
A.	An office located in a main building for administration of a development containing ten or more dwelling units;
B.	A laundry room for use of occupants of a development;
C.	A sauna, exercise room, clubhouse or similar facility for use of occupants of a development;
D.	Vending machines for candy, ice, soft drinks and sundries, located inside a building.
(Ord. 16653 § 2 (part), 2007)
